---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Layout
  title="Solar Panel Installation in Kochi | MNRE Approved | Rayenna Energy"
  description="Looking for solar panel installation in Kochi? Rayenna Energy is Kochi's MNRE-approved solar installer. PM Surya Ghar subsidy up to ₹78,000. Free site survey. Call +91 7907 369 304."
>

  <section class="area-hero">
    <img src={`${base}/media/hero (1).webp`} alt="Solar panels installed on a rooftop in Kochi, Kerala" class="area-hero__bg" />
    <div class="area-hero__overlay"></div>
    <div class="container area-hero__inner">
      <p class="area-hero__eyebrow">Serving Kochi & Ernakulam</p>
      <h1 class="area-hero__title">Solar Panel Installation<br />in Kochi</h1>
      <p class="area-hero__sub">Kerala's MNRE-approved solar installer — based in Vyttila, Kochi. Government subsidy up to ₹78,000. Free site survey. 25-year panel warranty.</p>
      <div class="area-hero__ctas">
        <a href={`${base}/solar-calculator`} class="btn btn-primary">☀️ Calculate My Savings</a>
        <a href={`${base}/contact`} class="btn btn-outline-light">Get a Free Quote →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== WHY KOCHI ===== -->
  <section class="area-why">
    <div class="container area-why__inner">
      <div class="area-why__content">
        <span class="section-tag">Kochi's Solar Advantage</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Why Kochi Is Ideal for Solar</h2>
        <p>Kochi receives over 2,000 peak sun hours per year — enough to make a rooftop solar system one of the most reliable investments a homeowner can make. Despite the monsoon season, Kochi's annual solar yield is consistently strong, and KSEB's net metering policy means every unit you generate (but don't consume) is credited back to your bill.</p>
        <p>As a Kochi-based company, Rayenna Energy understands local building types — from high-rise apartments in Kakkanad and Edapally to independent villas in Thevara and Vyttila. We handle KSEB net meter applications, structural assessments, and subsidy paperwork for every installation we complete in the district.</p>
        <ul class="area-facts">
          <li><span class="fact-icon">🌞</span><span><strong>2,000+ peak sun hours/year</strong> in Ernakulam district</span></li>
          <li><span class="fact-icon">🏠</span><span><strong>Installations across 15+ Kochi localities</strong> — Edapally, Thevara, Vyttila, Kakkanad, Fort Kochi, Palluruthy, Ravipuram and more</span></li>
          <li><span class="fact-icon">⚡</span><span><strong>KSEB net metering</strong> — export surplus units and reduce your bill to near zero</span></li>
          <li><span class="fact-icon">🏢</span><span><strong>Office 5 km from Kochi city centre</strong> — fastest response time for site surveys in Ernakulam</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="area-why__image">
        <img src={`${base}/media/solar-panel-installation.jpg`} alt="Rooftop solar installation in Kochi by Rayenna Energy" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== SUBSIDY ===== -->
  <section class="area-subsidy">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="area-subsidy__inner">
        <div class="subsidy-icon">🏛️</div>
        <div class="subsidy-content">
          <h2>PM Surya Ghar Subsidy Available in Kochi</h2>
          <p>Kochi homeowners are eligible for the central government's PM Surya Ghar Muft Bijli Yojana — a direct subsidy of up to <strong>₹78,000</strong> for systems up to 3 kW, and proportional support for larger systems. Rayenna handles the entire application process, including KSEB DISCom approval and portal submission, as part of every installation.</p>
          <div class="subsidy-table">
            <div class="subsidy-row"><span>1–2 kW system</span><strong>₹30,000 – ₹60,000 subsidy</strong></div>
            <div class="subsidy-row"><span>3 kW system</span><strong>₹78,000 subsidy</strong></div>
            <div class="subsidy-row"><span>3–10 kW system</span><strong>₹78,000 + 20% of excess cost</strong></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== LOCAL INSTALLATIONS ===== -->
  <section class="area-installs">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title text-center">Recent Kochi & Ernakulam Installations</h2>
      <div class="area-installs-grid">
        {[
          { name: 'Byju George',   location: 'Thevara',    cap: '10 kW', img: 'BYJU-GEORGE10KWTHEVARA-SOLIS-INVERTER-PANELS-WAAREE-1.jpeg' },
          { name: 'Angelo Thomas', location: 'Edapally',   cap: '10 kW', img: 'ANGELO-THOMAS-EDAPALLY-10KW-SOLIS-INVERTER-PANELS-WAAREE.png' },
          { name: 'Aysha George',  location: 'Ravipuram',  cap: '3 kW',  img: 'AYSHA-GEORGE-RAVIPURAM-3KW-SOLIS-INVERTER-PANELS-ADANI.png' },
          { name: 'Joseph K.V.',   location: 'Vennala',    cap: '5 kW',  img: 'JOSEPH-KV-VENNALA-5KW-SOLIS-INVERTER-PANELS-ADANI.png' },
        ].map(item => (
          <div class="area-install-card">
            <img src={`${base}/media/references/${item.img}`} alt={`${item.cap} solar installation for ${item.name} in ${item.location}, Kochi`} loading="lazy" />
            <div class="area-install-label">
              <strong>{item.name}</strong>
              <span>{item.location} · {item.cap}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="installs-cta-text"><a href={`${base}/media`}>See all our installations →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== LOCAL FAQ ===== -->
  <section class="area-faq">
    <div class="container area-faq__inner">
      <h2 class="section-title">Kochi Homeowners Ask</h2>
      <div class="area-faq__list">
        {[
          {
            q: 'Does heavy rainfall during Kerala\'s monsoon reduce solar output significantly?',
            a: 'Yes, generation drops during heavy overcast days — typically 20–40% in peak monsoon months (June–August). However, with 8–9 months of strong sunshine, your annual yield remains high. Systems are correctly sized to account for seasonal variation, so payback calculations factor in monsoon months.',
          },
          {
            q: 'Can I install solar on an apartment roof in Kochi?',
            a: 'Yes, if you have access to a dedicated roof area (typically 50–100 sq ft per kW) and the housing society permits it. Rayenna has completed apartment rooftop installations in Kakkanad, Edapally, and Fort Kochi. We can assess feasibility during the free site survey.',
          },
          {
            q: 'How long does the KSEB net metering approval take in Ernakulam?',
            a: 'KSEB typically processes net metering applications within 30–60 days after technical inspection. Rayenna submits all paperwork on your behalf and follows up with the local KSEB office, so you don\'t need to visit any government office.',
          },
          {
            q: 'Is sea air (salt mist) a problem for solar panels near the Kochi coast?',
            a: 'Salt-laden air can accelerate corrosion of cheaper mounting structures. Rayenna uses marine-grade anodised aluminium rails and stainless-steel fasteners for coastal installations — standard practice for all our installations in Fort Kochi, Palluruthy, and Cherai.',
          },
        ].map(item => (
          <details class="area-faq-item">
            <summary>{item.q}</summary>
            <p>{item.a}</p>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="area-faq__more">More questions? <a href={`${base}/faqs`}>Browse our full FAQ library →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== CTA ===== -->
  <section class="area-cta">
    <div class="container area-cta__inner">
      <div>
        <h2>Ready to Go Solar in Kochi?</h2>
        <p>Get a no-obligation site survey from our Kochi team. We'll assess your roof, calculate your potential savings, and walk you through the subsidy process — all for free.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="area-cta__btns">
        <a href={`${base}/contact`} class="btn btn-primary">Book a Free Site Survey</a>
        <a href={`${base}/solar-calculator`} class="btn btn-outline">☀️ Calculate Savings First</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
/* ===== AREA HERO ===== */
.area-hero {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 500px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  overflow: hidden;
  padding-bottom: 64px;
}
.area-hero__bg {
  position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover; object-position: center 25%; z-index: 0;
}
.area-hero__overlay {
  position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1;
  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(10,25,50,0.92) 0%, rgba(10,25,50,0.55) 50%, rgba(10,25,50,0.2) 100%);
}
.area-hero__inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding-top: 100px; }
.area-hero__eyebrow {
  font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 2.5px; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.area-hero__title {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
  font-weight: 500; color: #fff; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.area-hero__sub {
  font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 2vw, 1.05rem);
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); max-width: 540px; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 32px;
}
.area-hero__ctas { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; }
.btn-outline-light {
  border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.7); color: #fff;
  padding: 13px 28px; border-radius: 50px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95rem;
  transition: all var(--transition);
}
.btn-outline-light:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }

/* ===== WHY ===== */
.area-why { padding: var(--section-padding); background: var(--color-light); }
.area-why__inner {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center;
}
.area-why__content p { color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.area-why__content .section-title { margin: 12px 0 16px; }
.area-facts { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 24px 0 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
.area-facts li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; font-size: 0.93rem; line-height: 1.6; }
.fact-icon { font-size: 1.1rem; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.5; }
.area-why__image img {
  width: 100%; height: 320px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
}
@media (min-width: 900px) {
  .area-why__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
}

/* ===== SUBSIDY ===== */
.area-subsidy { padding: var(--section-padding); background: #fff; }
.area-subsidy__inner {
  display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start;
  background: #EEF6FF; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 36px 32px;
  border-left: 5px solid #2563eb;
}
.subsidy-icon { font-size: 2.4rem; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1; }
.subsidy-content h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-navy);
  margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 600;
}
.subsidy-content p { color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 0.95rem; }
.subsidy-table { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.subsidy-row {
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
  background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px;
  font-size: 0.9rem; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;
}
.subsidy-row span { color: var(--color-text-muted); }
.subsidy-row strong { color: #15803d; }

/* ===== LOCAL INSTALLS ===== */
.area-installs { padding: var(--section-padding); background: var(--color-light); }
.area-installs-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-top: 32px;
}
.area-install-card { position: relative; border-radius: var(--radius-md); overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 4/3; }
.area-install-card img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform 0.4s ease; }
.area-install-card:hover img { transform: scale(1.04); }
.area-install-label {
  position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(10,25,50,0.82) 0%, transparent 100%);
  padding: 20px 12px 12px;
}
.area-install-label strong { display: block; color: #fff; font-size: 0.85rem; font-family: var(--font-heading); }
.area-install-label span { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-size: 0.75rem; }
.installs-cta-text { text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
.installs-cta-text a { color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600; }
@media (min-width: 640px) {
  .area-installs-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
}

/* ===== FAQ ===== */
.area-faq { padding: var(--section-padding); background: #fff; }
.area-faq__inner { max-width: 800px; }
.area-faq__inner .section-title { margin-bottom: 32px; }
.area-faq__list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
.area-faq-item {
  border: 1.5px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  overflow: hidden; background: var(--color-light);
}
.area-faq-item summary {
  padding: 18px 20px; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--color-navy); cursor: pointer; list-style: none;
  position: relative; padding-right: 44px;
}
.area-faq-item summary::after {
  content: '+'; position: absolute; right: 18px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
  font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700; transition: transform 0.25s;
}
.area-faq-item[open] summary::after { transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(45deg); }
.area-faq-item p {
  padding: 0 20px 18px; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.8;
}
.area-faq__more { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
.area-faq__more a { color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600; }

/* ===== CTA BANNER ===== */
.area-cta { background: var(--color-secondary); padding: var(--section-padding); }
.area-cta__inner {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; align-items: flex-start;
}
.area-cta h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  color: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 500;
}
.area-cta p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; }
.area-cta__btns { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; }
.area-cta .btn-outline {
  border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6); color: #fff; background: transparent;
}
.area-cta .btn-outline:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .area-cta__inner { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
}
</style>
